  "prefLabel": "Env-A 308.02 Determination of Attainment of Lead Standards",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 308.02 Determination of Attainment of Lead Standards. The primary and secondary ambient air quality standards for lead specified in Env-A 308.01 shall be deemed to be attained when the maximum arithmetic 3-month mean concentration for a 3-year period, as determined in accordance with 40 CFR 50 Appendix R, is less than or equal to 0.15 μg/m3.\n\nSource. #6227, eff 4-25-96; ss by #8054, eff 2-28-04; ss by #10173, eff 9-1-12; ss by #13382, eff 5-25-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a300.html"
